{"availability":"available","full":"ailaflow/ailaflow","name":"ailaflow","description":"AilaFlow is a self-hosted, low-code AI workspace for teams. Build workflows, connect tools, and set the rules. Your team works through AI chat and forms - no technical expertise needed.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-24T19:15:48Z","updated":"2026-10-02T10:33:32Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://ailaflow.com","topics":["ai","ai-agents","ai-workspaces","automation","self-hosted","workflow","workflow-automation","workspace"],"demo":null,"color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Tell AI to build your workspace, powered by processes with Human-AI interfaces.","AilaFlow is a collaborative low-code workspace where people and AI agents design, automate, and execute business processes together. Processes can combine human tasks, AI agents, forms, scripts, shared data, and external systems-giving humans and AI a common way to participate in the same workflow and act on the same process state.","Let AI build your processes, including integrations with external systems using Node.js and NPM packages, with the code running safely in isolated sandboxes. Bring AilaFlow into your existing workflow through Slack and Telegram."],"features":["Build your first process"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ailaflow/ailaflow/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bb7295619ae3ceaeba111a7332d6e28d341b3295455a98d70dcdcff42e9e8049","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Tell AI to build your workspace, powered